WEBVTT

00:02:27.600 --> 00:02:31.249
Bu vaqt va makon o'rtasidagi tafovutni
olib tashlaydi va evolyutsiya qonun-

00:02:31.249 --> 00:02:39.446
-lari ham koinotning dastlabki holatini 
belgilab berishi mumkinligini anglatadi.

00:02:39.446 --> 00:02:46.616
Koinot o'z-o'zidan 
yo'qdan bor bo'lishi mumkin.

00:02:46.616 --> 00:02:51.036
Bundan tashqari, biz 
koinotning turli holatlarda

00:02:51.036 --> 00:02:54.430
yarilishi ehtimollarini 
hisoblab chiqishimiz mumkin.

00:02:54.430 --> 00:02:56.818
Mazkur bashoratlar WMAP
sun'iy yo'ldoshi tomonidan

00:02:56.818 --> 00:03:02.998
kuzatilgan va koinot yaralishining 
alomati hisoblangan